    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "pedialyte is so expensive though and i don't have any at home right now. he's just acting a bit sluggish, i don't think it's an emergency. can't i just mix a tiny bit of salt and some baking soda in his water? it should be basically the same thing as the electrolytes in the store bought stuff right? i just want to get him some energy back.",
